{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is The Ghost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt ghosts in cursed houses - alone or with friends. Gather evidence, survive deadly events, and uncover the ghost before it finds you. Every mistake can end your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Dangerous Ghost Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable events can end your mission at any moment. Stay calm or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/a597fa769e5056780a8c952c16d27746.poster.avif?t=1774446856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/a597fa769e5056780a8c952c16d27746.webm?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/a597fa769e5056780a8c952c16d27746.mp4?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Evidence</strong> and Identify the Ghost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, investigate, and combine clues to uncover what you\u2019re dealing with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/3b21ba92c80a6f85412850f3f6688567.poster.avif?t=1774446856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/3b21ba92c80a6f85412850f3f6688567.webm?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/3b21ba92c80a6f85412850f3f6688567.mp4?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo</strong> or in <strong>Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up tasks, save each other or fail together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/6c4fe6eb0c88b6c83a154a0d34629fe0.poster.avif?t=1774446856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/6c4fe6eb0c88b6c83a154a0d34629fe0.webm?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/6c4fe6eb0c88b6c83a154a0d34629fe0.mp4?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Ranks</strong> of the Company</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards, compete with other hunters, and become the best recruit of the Hunter Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/ca27c4ab3a58999189d01c7019f5d945.poster.avif?t=1774446856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/ca27c4ab3a58999189d01c7019f5d945.webm?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/ca27c4ab3a58999189d01c7019f5d945.mp4?t=1774446856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities and improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929260/extras/e2f836c7f7197abcf61a